# External reference library

Consult these official docs when working on Digifact integration, FEL certification, or MCP tooling in this project.

## Digifact

- **MCP (SSE) documentation:** https://documentacion.digifact.com/mcp/sse  
  Digifact MCP server documentation (Server-Sent Events). Use for MCP tool schemas, certification flows, and certificador-related integration.

- **NUC JSON (Guatemala):** https://documentacion.digifact.com/gt/nuc/json  
  NUC field reference for GT FEL (FACT/FCAM). Sector taxes such as **TIMBRE DE PRENSA** use `Items[].Taxes.Tax[]` with `Code: "1"` (D1011 unidad gravable), `Description: "TIMBRE DE PRENSA"`, `TaxableAmount`, and `Amount` (IVA uses the same `Code` field with value `"1"` for a different tax type).
